---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import AppSidebar from "../components/AppSidebar.astro";
import AppTopbar from "../components/AppTopbar.astro";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><BaseHead title="Connect iPhone — Paisa Inbox" description="Securely connect the Paisa Inbox iPhone app to your financial inbox." /></head>
  <body>
    <div class="app-shell">
      <AppSidebar />
      <main>
        <AppTopbar title="Connect iPhone" subtitle="PRIVATE, ACCOUNT-LEVEL SYNC" action="none" />
        <section class="workspace-page connect-page">
          <div class="page-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">CROSS-DEVICE SYNC</span><h2>Your financial inbox, on every screen.</h2><p>ChatGPT verifies your identity for sign-in only. Paisa Inbox receives a revocable sync token—not your browser session, password, or permission to analyse transactions.</p></div><a class="secondary-button" href="/">← Back to dashboard</a></div>
          <div class="connect-grid">
            <section class="panel connect-card">
              <span class="eyebrow">ONE-TIME CONNECTION</span>
              <h3>Connect from your iPhone</h3>
              <p>In Paisa Inbox, open <strong>Settings → Sign in to sync</strong>. Use the same identity as this dashboard and Paisa Inbox will return to the app and sync automatically.</p>
              <div class="connect-result success">Your financial data stays behind two checks: private site access and a device-specific token stored in Keychain.</div>
            </section>
            <section class="panel device-card">
              <div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR DEVICES</span><h3>Connected securely</h3></div></div>
              <div id="connected-devices" aria-busy="true"><div class="device-skeleton"><span class="skeleton-avatar"></span><span><i class="skeleton-line medium"></i><i class="skeleton-line short"></i></span></div></div>
              <p class="device-note">Device tokens are stored in the iPhone Keychain. Disconnecting the app revokes its token without deleting financial records.</p>
            </section>
          </div>
        </section>
        <footer><span>Your phone never receives your browser session.</span><span><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms</a></span></footer>
      </main>
    </div>
    <script is:inline src="/connect-device.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
